WEBVTT

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:03.550
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:06.520
My field!

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:08.250
I'll destroy that one.

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:20.570
Revolver, I'm sorry.

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:27.670
Wait.

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:31.600
Even the weak have their uses.

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:54.320
Our lives aren't forever

00:00:55.120 --> 00:01:01.110
We wander, searching for the meaning of life

00:01:02.060 --> 00:01:08.430
Even if it's not the right direction, 
just keep looking forward

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:15.000
Sharing hope for the future

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:21.750
tell me  We're searching for 
memories lost in the darkness

00:01:21.940 --> 00:01:28.980
I feel your flame  Your 
impulses pierce the light

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:35.690
I want to share your pain

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:12.080
Spectre...

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:15.450
They ended the broadcast.

00:02:17.890 --> 00:02:19.180
Jin...

00:02:21.460 --> 00:02:25.490
Blue Maiden, we may fight next.

00:02:25.490 --> 00:02:26.690
Be careful.

00:02:27.220 --> 00:02:28.390
Right.

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:30.170
He truly is strong.

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:32.100
Lightning is special.

00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:36.300
Spectre, I won't let your 
sacrifice go to waste.

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:42.960
Just wait, Revolver.

00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:44.880
I'll erase you next.

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:46.750
Wait.

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:48.710
Save Revolver for later.

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:51.450
Why won't you let me?

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:56.490
I'm itching to defeat that punk!

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:59.960
You've lost your cool.

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:02.480
Wait a sec, Lightning-

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:05.900
I want you to defeat someone else first.

00:03:05.900 --> 00:03:08.900
Fine.  If that's what you want.

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:10.870
So who?

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:15.070
Bohman will probably fight Blue Maiden.

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:17.280
That means...

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:25.450
It's a graveyard for airplanes.

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:30.440
Did it move?

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:32.560
But no one's on board.

00:03:39.630 --> 00:03:42.330
What's going on?

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:44.600
Do ghost airplanes exist?

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:47.070
Don't say things like that!

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:52.040
Oh yeah.  You're afraid of ghosts.

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:54.030
Be quiet!  Ignore that-

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:57.250
But this is different.  Is it the wind?

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:03.180
They've blocked our way.

00:04:07.340 --> 00:04:08.430
Windy.

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:12.680
Where are we?

00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:14.900
Boss!  Over there!

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:17.360
The broadcasters have arrived.

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:19.680
Hello, Windy.

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:22.610
So we're broadcasting you this time!

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:26.100
Boss, I don't agree with this!

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:28.610
If we disobey, we'll be smashed to bits!

00:04:28.610 --> 00:04:30.080
Just film!

00:04:39.580 --> 00:04:41.160
That's Windy.

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:43.530
He's with Soulburner!

00:04:45.980 --> 00:04:48.570
So this is where we'll fight.

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:50.120
Exactly.

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:51.980
Can't wait to fight!

00:04:51.980 --> 00:04:54.210
Flame, prepare yourself.

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:56.110
Hey!  Don't ignore me-

00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:59.110
How unexpected that you'd come to us.

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:03.350
You're scared to face Revolver 
because he beat you.

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:05.820
What?  Stop joking!

00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:13.520
Wait a sec...  Does that mean you 
think we're weaker than Revolver?

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:14.790
Soulburner...

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:18.480
I see!  I totally get it!

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:22.170
Since he didn't come here, 
they think I'm the strongest!

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:23.230
Be quiet.

00:05:23.230 --> 00:05:26.520
You're not weak.

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:28.360
Then what?

00:05:28.360 --> 00:05:29.970
You're super weak!

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:32.350
How dare you!

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:36.730
Soulburner, don't lose 
your cool before Windy.

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:38.950
Try to figure out my plan.

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:42.360
You're inciting him on purpose?

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:47.230
In his duel against Revolver, 
he lost his cool and lost.

00:05:47.230 --> 00:05:50.930
We should use his emotions to our advantage.

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:53.400
Finished discussing your strategy?

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:59.870
Yeah.  We were discussing how we'll defy 
your expectations by not being weak.

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:03.400
Flame, I never liked you!

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:07.610
Always acting like you know everything!

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:11.000
But I don't dislike you.

00:06:11.340 --> 00:06:15.900
You didn't used to be this twisted.

00:06:15.900 --> 00:06:18.090
What happened?

00:06:18.380 --> 00:06:20.080
Nothing happened.

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:21.070
This is me.

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:23.530
If that's true...

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:25.500
I can't forgive you!

00:06:27.630 --> 00:06:31.180
We believed in you, but you betrayed us.

00:06:31.180 --> 00:06:34.410
You and Lightning destroyed our homeworld.

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:37.210
I don't want you to forgive me anyway!

00:06:37.210 --> 00:06:38.640
Not even a little!

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:41.780
I'm tired of talking!

00:06:41.780 --> 00:06:43.960
I'll pummel you quick!

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:45.420
I got other things to do!

00:06:45.780 --> 00:06:48.420
Is he losing his cool?

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:50.120
Hope so.

00:06:50.440 --> 00:06:51.540
Duel!

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:55.690
Be careful, Flame.

00:06:55.690 --> 00:06:59.100
Windy is dangerous.  He even 
eliminated his partner.

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:01.470
He'll do anything to win.

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:07.110
I'll go first.

00:07:08.130 --> 00:07:11.810
I activate Stormrider Griffore's 
effect from my hand!

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:16.280
When there are no cards on the 
field, I can look at your hand.

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:19.280
If you have any spell or trap cards...

00:07:19.280 --> 00:07:24.260
...I select one and set it on your 
field to Special Summon this card.

00:07:25.230 --> 00:07:27.960
He's already meddling with our hand!

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:30.430
Now show me!

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:37.870
Set that one.

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:44.380
The Counter Trap, Salamangreat Roar.

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:47.180
Come, Stormrider Griffore!

00:07:50.270 --> 00:07:54.390
I activate Stormrider Hippogriff's 
effect from my hand!

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:59.860
If there's a card in your Spell & 
Trap Zone, I can Special Summon it!

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:06.700
Appear!  The circuit that rages before me!

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:10.670
The summoning conditions are two Stormriders!

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:12.540
Link Summon!

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:18.220
Appear!  Link 2 Stormridership Rockbuster!

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:22.180
I activate the Link Material 
Hippogriff's effect!

00:08:22.420 --> 00:08:28.650
When there's only one card in your Spell & 
Trap Zone, that card is sent to the graveyard!

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:33.120
Then you draw one card from your deck!

00:08:34.670 --> 00:08:36.040
I'm not done!

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:38.960
Stormrider Skyfisher's effect from my hand!

00:08:39.180 --> 00:08:44.400
When there are no cards in my Spell 
& Trap Zone, I can Special Summon it!

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:49.510
Then you set a spell or trap 
card from your graveyard!

00:08:52.990 --> 00:08:55.810
It's like he's playing this duel for us!

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:59.040
I set Salamangreat Roar from my graveyard!

00:09:00.150 --> 00:09:04.890
But when Skyfisher's effect sets 
a card, that card can't activate.

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:11.700
Appear again!  The circuit 
that rages before me!

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:15.170
The summoning conditions are 
at least two Stormriders!

00:09:16.970 --> 00:09:18.370
Link Summon!

00:09:18.770 --> 00:09:25.740
Appear!  Link 3 Stormridership 
Bahamut Bomber!

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:30.250
What?

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:33.220
He summoned his ace monster 
on the first turn!

00:09:33.220 --> 00:09:35.690
Bahamut Bomber's effect activates!

00:09:35.690 --> 00:09:41.650
Once per turn, when I Special Summon it when 
there are no cards in my Spell & Trap Zone...

00:09:41.650 --> 00:09:45.900
...I destroy one of your cards, 
and you take 500 damage!

00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:49.250
My oh my!

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:52.580
How lucky!  You have a set card!

00:09:55.600 --> 00:09:58.310
Such bad acting.

00:09:58.310 --> 00:10:00.680
He used our Roar to his advantage.

00:10:00.920 --> 00:10:03.160
This is just a light jab.

00:10:03.160 --> 00:10:05.950
I'll KO you later.

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:08.050
I end my turn.

00:10:08.050 --> 00:10:10.510
He gets on my nerves!

00:10:10.510 --> 00:10:11.670
Soulburner.

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:13.350
I know!

00:10:13.350 --> 00:10:16.160
Here we go!

00:10:16.540 --> 00:10:18.130
My turn!  I draw!

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:21.180
I summon Salamangreat Falco!

00:10:23.830 --> 00:10:27.360
Appear!  The circuit that changes the future!

00:10:27.760 --> 00:10:31.880
The summoning condition is 
one Level 4 or lower Cyverse!

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:34.310
Link Summon!

00:10:34.540 --> 00:10:39.050
Appear!  Link 1 Salamangreat Balelynx!

00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:41.400
Balelynx's effect!

00:10:41.400 --> 00:10:43.310
When it's Link Summoned...

00:10:43.310 --> 00:10:48.090
...I can add the Field Spell, Salamangreat 
Sanctuary from my deck to my hand!

00:10:48.300 --> 00:10:52.560
I can use Falco's effect to set 
Salamangreat Roar from my graveyard.

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:55.530
But it'll only fall prey to Bahamut Bomber.

00:10:55.530 --> 00:10:56.690
That's right.

00:10:56.690 --> 00:11:02.510
On the turn I Link Summon, I can activate 
Salamangreat Mole's effect from my hand!

00:11:02.510 --> 00:11:06.110
I Special Summon it next 
to my Link Monster's link!

00:11:07.920 --> 00:11:11.950
Appear again!  The circuit 
that changes the future!

00:11:12.640 --> 00:11:16.920
The summoning conditions are 
two Fire Effect Monsters!

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:19.560
Link Summon!

00:11:19.960 --> 00:11:24.910
Appear!  Link 2 Salamangreat Sunlight Wolf!

00:11:25.940 --> 00:11:29.670
I activate Salamangreat 
Fowl's effect from my hand!

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:37.280
When a different Salamangreat is summoned or 
Special Summoned, it Special Summons itself!

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:42.650
And Sunlight Wolf's effect activates!

00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:47.570
When a monster is summoned or Special 
Summoned next to this card's link...

00:11:47.570 --> 00:11:50.350
...I return a Salamangreat 
in the graveyard to my hand!

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:53.290
I return Falco from my graveyard!

00:11:53.640 --> 00:11:57.130
Soulburner's deck is working pretty well!

00:11:58.600 --> 00:12:02.250
Appear for a third time!  The 
circuit that changes the future!

00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:07.110
The summoning conditions are at 
least two Fire Effect Monsters!

00:12:07.440 --> 00:12:09.410
Link Summon!

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:15.550
Appear!  Link 3 Salamangreat Heatleo!

00:12:16.260 --> 00:12:20.950
I activate the Field Spell, 
Salamangreat Sanctuary!

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:23.390
Now I'm ready!

00:12:23.390 --> 00:12:24.590
Here I go!

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:26.960
Wait!  Don't rush the fight!

00:12:26.960 --> 00:12:28.550
What do you mean?

00:12:28.550 --> 00:12:30.430
Now's the time to go for it!

00:12:30.700 --> 00:12:31.900
But...

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:36.500
Isn't he a nuisance, Flame?

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:40.310
A nuisance?

00:12:40.310 --> 00:12:43.310
Don't you want to fight using your own will?

00:12:43.310 --> 00:12:46.610
Partners are a nuisance.

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:49.850
Is that why you offed your partner?

00:12:49.850 --> 00:12:51.580
Yeah.

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:56.320
And how did it feel to off your partner?

00:12:58.300 --> 00:13:00.790
I'm asking how you felt!

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:06.760
Nothing special.  Just 
that a nuisance was gone.

00:13:06.770 --> 00:13:08.730
Nuisance?

00:13:08.940 --> 00:13:16.940
During the Lost Incident, the captured spent 
everyday in an unimaginable situation.

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:22.650
Despair day after day.

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:28.620
But we held on to the tiniest hope 
that someone would save us someday.

00:13:30.190 --> 00:13:36.110
When that hope became 
reality, we were so happy!

00:13:37.630 --> 00:13:42.370
But you stole it from him because 
you thought he was a nuisance?

00:13:42.370 --> 00:13:44.340
Yeah, that's right.

00:13:44.580 --> 00:13:48.810
You don't know how it feels to finally 
get hope and have it stolen away!

00:13:51.500 --> 00:13:55.170
Oh yeah.  It did look like he felt hope.

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:06.390
How lame.

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:13.630
Windy, we were able to be created because 
they spent day after day enduring despair.

00:14:14.350 --> 00:14:20.100
We should thank them.  We have 
no right to steal their hope!

00:14:27.360 --> 00:14:33.720
Flame, it seems you've also 
completely lost your way.

00:14:33.940 --> 00:14:36.130
Oh, I get it.

00:14:36.130 --> 00:14:40.550
I should say thank you for creating me?

00:14:40.550 --> 00:14:47.200
Never!  I'll make you understand that 
partners are pointless and a hindrance!

00:14:47.480 --> 00:14:48.930
Windy!

00:14:48.930 --> 00:14:53.400
But by the time you understand, 
you'll be erased.

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:57.640
Windy, I never thought you were this rotten!

00:14:57.640 --> 00:15:00.420
Flame, enough talk.

00:15:00.420 --> 00:15:03.150
I'll crush him without mercy!

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:09.090
I don't like violent words, 
but I'll ignore it this time.

00:15:09.090 --> 00:15:13.930
Whatever!  The wind of victory blows for me!

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:18.060
Here I go!  Stormrider Gargoyle's 
effect from my hand!

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:22.800
When your Field Spell activates, 
I send this card to the graveyard.

00:15:23.140 --> 00:15:27.870
I can activate the Field Spell, 
Stormrider Turbulence from my deck!

00:15:29.230 --> 00:15:35.000
Due to Turbulence's effect, 
Stormriders gain 300 ATK!

00:15:35.220 --> 00:15:44.460
You plan to Reincarnation Link Summon Heatleo 
and use its effect to lower Bahamut Bomber's ATK.

00:15:44.740 --> 00:15:46.350
Too bad!

00:15:46.350 --> 00:15:49.480
Due to Turbulence, when there's 
only one Stormrider...

00:15:49.480 --> 00:15:54.370
...and you Special Summon a Link Monster 
with equal or greater Link Markers...

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:58.860
...that effect is negated 
until your next turn!

00:15:58.860 --> 00:16:00.840
You can't reincarnate!

00:16:01.170 --> 00:16:02.110
I'm not done!

00:16:02.110 --> 00:16:05.880
I activate Salamangreat Beat 
Bison's effect from my hand!

00:16:06.100 --> 00:16:11.850
When there are at least three Salamangreats in the 
graveyard, I can Special Summon it in defense position!

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:18.800
Beat Bison's additional effect!

00:16:18.800 --> 00:16:21.830
For every faceup card on your field...

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:26.560
...I can return a Fire Link Monster 
in the graveyard to the Extra Deck!

00:16:27.310 --> 00:16:29.570
I return Sunlight Wolf!

00:16:30.030 --> 00:16:36.270
And for every card I returned, I 
can negate your card this turn!

00:16:36.900 --> 00:16:37.750
What?

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:41.250
I negate Turbulence's effect!

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:49.350
The Field Spell, Salamangreat 
Sanctuary's effect!

00:16:49.840 --> 00:16:55.330
I can use a Salamangreat Link Monster 
with the same name to Link Summon!

00:16:55.330 --> 00:16:57.460
Reincarnation Link Summon!

00:16:57.880 --> 00:17:02.290
Appear!  Salamangreat Heatleo!

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:08.970
He can use Heatleo's effect 
to lower Bahamut Bomber's ATK.

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:12.210
All right!  Start the counterattack!

00:17:12.210 --> 00:17:14.400
Not good enough!

00:17:14.400 --> 00:17:17.970
I banish Gargoyle from my graveyard 
to activate its effect!

00:17:17.970 --> 00:17:19.950
I send Turbulence to the graveyard!

00:17:20.320 --> 00:17:25.190
To activate the Field Spell, 
Stormrider Blast from my deck!

00:17:25.400 --> 00:17:29.930
Stormriders gain 400 ATK!

00:17:30.300 --> 00:17:37.870
And for every Stormrider Field Spell 
in the graveyard, it gains 300 ATK!

00:17:38.260 --> 00:17:43.470
Even if he raises its ATK, it's pointless 
if Heatleo's effect is in play.

00:17:43.470 --> 00:17:46.050
Due to Stormrider Blast's effect...

00:17:46.050 --> 00:17:53.450
...since your Link Monster has equal or fewer Link 
Markers than Bahamut Bomber, its effects are negated!

00:17:53.450 --> 00:17:57.920
And when there's a Stormrider Link 
Monster in the Extra Monster Zone...

00:17:57.920 --> 00:18:05.160
...your monsters can only attack it, and 
all monsters that can attack must attack!

00:18:08.470 --> 00:18:09.610
Oh no!

00:18:09.610 --> 00:18:12.240
Bring it on!

00:18:14.210 --> 00:18:18.750
Battle!  Heatleo attacks Bahamut Bomber!

00:18:19.930 --> 00:18:23.580
Bye, Leo!  Don't reincarnate again!

00:18:25.320 --> 00:18:27.520
Balelynx's effect from my graveyard!

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:32.720
When a Salamangreat on the field is 
destroyed, I can banish this card instead!

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:35.190
Now it won't be destroyed.

00:18:35.190 --> 00:18:37.930
But you still take damage.

00:18:39.870 --> 00:18:41.670
I end my turn!

00:18:41.670 --> 00:18:43.830
Too bad!

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:47.010
You went all out, but you 
didn't even take a step!

00:18:47.010 --> 00:18:48.930
Understand now, Flame?

00:18:48.930 --> 00:18:52.910
Human partners can't do much.

00:18:53.240 --> 00:18:55.150
I disagree.

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:58.120
You're pathetic.

00:18:58.120 --> 00:19:00.460
My turn.  I draw.

00:19:01.400 --> 00:19:05.010
I activate Stormrider Skyfisher's 
effect from my hand.

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:08.180
Due to its own effect, 
I can Special Summon it.

00:19:09.060 --> 00:19:13.300
Then you set a spell or trap 
card from your graveyard.

00:19:13.300 --> 00:19:16.410
I set Salamangreat Roar!

00:19:16.410 --> 00:19:21.870
Bahamut Bomber's effect destroys 
Roar, and you take 500 damage.

00:19:29.820 --> 00:19:34.050
Appear!  The circuit that rages before me!

00:19:34.050 --> 00:19:37.790
The summoning condition is one 
Level 2 or lower Stormrider!

00:19:38.020 --> 00:19:39.520
Link Summon!

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:44.450
Appear!  Link 1 Stormridership Stratastorm!

00:19:45.930 --> 00:19:52.400
Due to Stormrider Blast's effect, 
Stratastorm gains a total of 700 ATK!

